{"ref":"BDB, שְׁבוּאֵל","hw":"שְׁבוּאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבוּאֵל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבֻאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> son of Gershom <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.16\">1 Ch 23:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.24\">26:24</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(שְׁבֻ׳)</span>, = <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּבָאֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.20\">24:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, of Herman <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.4\">25:4</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּבָאֵל</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.20\">20</a> (cf. Benz on these lists).—𝔊 in all usually Σουβαηλ, 𝔊L usually —βιηλ.","next":"BDB, תִּשְׁבֶּה","prev":"BDB, שֹׁבָ֑י"}